    In int2i(as.integer(i), n) : NAs introduced by coercion to integer range

I haven't been able to figure out what I need to correct for this to work and I'm hoping someone here has seen this before and can point me in the direction of a solution. The only other detail of note is that when I create the poly.barrier object, I get a warning:

mesh.polys is invalid
mesh.polys is invalid
Warning messages:
