  Invalid objects found; consider using set_RGEOS_CheckValidity(2L)

I'm not sure if this is related to the error when trying to run the inla.barrier.pcmatern() function and it didn't seem to have any effect on the poly.barrier object which I was able to plot without issue. Again, I appreciate any assistance or suggestions for getting through this latest issue.
